# Rust / Anchor build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# NEVER commit signing keys or secrets.
# The program's authority secret is OPERATOR-HELD, off-repo
# (~/.audit-keys or ...\Jelleo\.audit-keys). These patterns are a
# defense-in-depth backstop in case this dir is ever `git init`ed.
keys/
*-authority.json
*keypair*.json
secret.txt
*.secret
id.json
